<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Love Me Back</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">fromis_9</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Love Me Back (From "Operation: True Love")</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2IMPPA9UZpqTnnVIy9lDHU</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.320" end="00:02.820">Hey</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.480" end="00:04.140">It's me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.140" end="00:05.990">Things have been weird</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.990" end="00:10.590">눈이 가 자꾸 왜 이래 woo</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.590" end="00:14.990">조절이 안돼 이제 oh no</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.990" end="00:18.190">왜 혼자서만 이래</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.190" end="00:19.690">복잡해져</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.990" end="00:22.090">Then let me just make it simple</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.090" end="00:24.490">Oh you're all I think about yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.490" end="00:26.990">I love to get your attention babe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.990" end="00:29.990">Yeah yeah what I need is only you bebe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.990" end="00:33.490">너도 너도 그렇다고 말해줘</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.490" end="00:36.790">애써 애써 숨기지는 말아줘</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.790" end="00:39.590">I love to feel the attraction babe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.590" end="00:42.590">Yeah yeah what I need is only you bebe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.590" end="00:46.090">자꾸 애써 숨기려고 하지 마</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.090" end="00:47.890">Just say what's right now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.890" end="00:50.390">I know you love me back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.390" end="00:51.990">말하지 않아도</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.990" end="00:54.690">Oh I know you love me back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.690" end="00:56.390">티내지 않아도</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.390" end="00:58.790">Maybe you don't love me back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.790" end="01:02.090">떨리는 이 느낌 feel so high</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.090" end="01:03.990">Just let me tell you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.990" end="01:06.390">나에게만 only</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.390" end="01:09.190">달콤하게 holy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.190" end="01:11.490">달아오른 두 볼이</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.490" end="01:12.990">Show it to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.790" end="01:15.390">기다려져 call me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.390" end="01:18.090">확실히 난 fallin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.090" end="01:20.390">차오르는 웃음이</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.390" end="01:22.290">번져가잖아 yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.290" end="01:25.590">태연하게 가려준 햇빛</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.590" end="01:28.990">하나하나 왠지 묻고 싶어</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.990" end="01:32.490">궁금한 게 없는 것 같아</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.490" end="01:34.690">Do you want, want, want me too?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.690" end="01:37.890">매일 길을 잃어</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.890" end="01:40.890">What if you go away away away?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.890" end="01:43.390">I love to get your attention babe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.390" end="01:46.390">Yeah yeah what I need is only you bebe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.390" end="01:49.890">너도 너도 그렇다고 말해줘</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.890" end="01:53.090">애써 애써 숨기지는 말아줘</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.090" end="01:55.790">I love to feel the attraction babe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.790" end="01:58.790">Yeah yeah what I need is only you bebe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.790" end="02:02.290">자꾸 애써 숨기려고 하지 마</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.290" end="02:04.090">Just say what's right now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.090" end="02:06.590">I know you love me back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.590" end="02:08.190">말하지 않아도</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.190" end="02:10.890">Oh I know you love me back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.890" end="02:12.690">티내지 않아도</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.690" end="02:15.090">Maybe you don't love me back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.090" end="02:18.190">떨리는 이 느낌 feel so high</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.190" end="02:19.690">Just let me tell you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.490" end="02:22.090">Waiting for your call</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.090" end="02:25.090">매일 밤 생각나</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.090" end="02:28.390">I just wanna fall in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.390" end="02:31.090">우연인 척 또</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.090" end="02:34.090">눈을 마주쳐</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.090" end="02:36.090">그럼 뭐 어때</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.090" end="02:37.590">Hi you, hi you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.490" end="02:40.090">I know you love me back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.090" end="02:41.590">말하지 않아도</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.590" end="02:44.290">Oh I know you love me back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.290" end="02:46.090">티내지 않아도</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.090" end="02:48.490">Maybe you don't love me back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.490" end="02:51.690">떨리는 이 느낌 feel so high</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.690" end="02:53.490">Just let me tell you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.490" end="02:55.990">나에게만 only</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.990" end="02:58.690">달콤하게 holy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.690" end="03:00.990">달아오른 두 볼이</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.990" end="03:02.490">Show it to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.390" end="03:04.990">기다려져 call me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.990" end="03:07.690">확실히 난 fallin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.690" end="03:10.090">차오르는 웃음이</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.090" end="03:14.090">번져가잖아 yeah</p></div></body></tt>